SUMMARY:Pitch Black: An Innovation Challenge
DESCRIPTION:Pitch Black gives students the opportunity to explore entrepr
 eneurship\, innovation\, and problem-solving while addressing challenges 
 affecting Black and other minority communities and college students.  Par
 ticipants will strengthen their creativity\, teamwork\, and presentation 
 skills while developing meaningful solutions. Students will present their
  ideas to a panel of faculty judges\, receive feedback\, and compete for 
 awards.  This event is a great opportunity to connect with others\, devel
 op valuable skills\, and make an impact through innovation! Food will be 
 provided!
